WEBVTT

00:01.967 --> 00:03.297
[♪ somber music playing]

00:08.017 --> 00:09.187
[LEON] <i>The war had ended.</i>

00:09.267 --> 00:10.687
<i>Peace between the kingdom</i>

00:10.767 --> 00:12.557
<i>and principality</i>
<i>was established.</i>

00:15.107 --> 00:17.437
<i>Holfort's attention</i>
<i>was soon turned elsewhere.</i>

00:17.777 --> 00:19.187
<i>Nations took advantage</i>
<i>of the situation</i>

00:19.277 --> 00:22.197
<i>by invading,</i>
<i>and they were dealt with.</i>

00:23.947 --> 00:26.657
<i>As for the principality,</i>
<i>it was no more.</i>

00:26.737 --> 00:29.077
<i>House Fanoss</i>
<i>rejoined the kingdom as a duchy.</i>

00:34.957 --> 00:36.997
<i>On top of</i>
<i>the exorbitant reparations</i>

00:37.087 --> 00:39.047
<i>that were demanded</i>
<i>for their actions,</i>

00:39.127 --> 00:40.377
<i>the kingdom was also pushing</i>

00:40.467 --> 00:42.887
<i>for an unfair</i>
<i>and humiliating treaty.</i>

00:44.297 --> 00:45.387
-Queen Mylene.
-Mm?

00:45.467 --> 00:47.097
-[women sigh dreamily]
-[Leon laughing]

00:47.177 --> 00:51.387
<i>Meanwhile, I was in high spirits</i>
<i>from all the attention!</i>

00:53.977 --> 00:55.897
[gasps]

00:59.027 --> 01:00.147
[MYLENE] Viscount Bartfort!

01:01.447 --> 01:02.527
Help me.

01:02.857 --> 01:04.157
I have a request.

01:04.237 --> 01:05.527
Uh...

01:05.617 --> 01:08.367
Whatever it is,
there's no bowing required.

01:08.697 --> 01:09.907
Just go ahead and ask.

01:11.497 --> 01:12.417
Save him.

01:13.417 --> 01:15.497
Please spare Julius
and his friends.

01:16.287 --> 01:17.207
Say what?

01:19.007 --> 01:21.417
You're in jail?
Somehow I'm not surprised.

01:21.507 --> 01:22.427
THIS WORLD
IS REALLY TOUGH FOR MOBS

01:22.507 --> 01:23.887
[JULIUS]
We don't need your help.

01:23.967 --> 01:24.967
[all groan softly]

01:25.047 --> 01:26.927
Speak for yourself!
I'll take their help!

01:27.007 --> 01:30.307
I don't wanna be executed!
Get me out! [crying]

01:30.387 --> 01:31.727
Stop your whining.

01:31.807 --> 01:32.727
If you wanna blame anyone,

01:32.807 --> 01:35.147
blame this idiot
for insulting House Fanoss.

01:35.897 --> 01:38.147
I caused a little commotion,
nothing more.

01:38.937 --> 01:41.147
I merely said
I wouldn't marry Hertrude.

01:41.237 --> 01:43.067
It was being done
to push an unfair treaty

01:43.147 --> 01:44.067
on the principality.

01:44.147 --> 01:45.067
[Marie continues crying]

01:45.157 --> 01:47.027
[JULIUS] I refuse
to be anyone's pawn!

01:47.117 --> 01:50.037
And because of your integrity,
the palace completely lost face.

01:50.117 --> 01:51.497
Look, they were forced
to compromise

01:51.577 --> 01:52.497
heavily on the treaty.

01:52.577 --> 01:53.787
What did you think
was gonna happen?

01:55.367 --> 01:56.287
[HERTRUDE] Unreal.

01:57.497 --> 02:00.627
I never thought that
idiot prince would be my savior.

02:04.177 --> 02:07.177
[LEON] Not to mention you four
went crazy at the temple.

02:07.677 --> 02:10.507
Only because we were trying
to stop Marie's execution!

02:10.597 --> 02:13.137
You might believe she's a fraud,
but she's still our Saint!

02:14.017 --> 02:16.057
We'll never regret
defending her!

02:16.147 --> 02:18.567
We're ready to live
and die for Marie's sake!

02:19.317 --> 02:20.357
You're dead, all right.

02:20.437 --> 02:21.477
You've managed to make enemies

02:21.567 --> 02:23.447
of both the palace
and the temple.

02:23.527 --> 02:24.447
Accept your deaths.

02:24.527 --> 02:26.947
What? No!

02:27.027 --> 02:30.287
I'm too cute to be executed!

02:30.367 --> 02:31.447
[sighs]

02:32.407 --> 02:33.827
Have you lost your mind?

02:34.197 --> 02:36.167
You want to exchange everything
you earned in the war

02:36.247 --> 02:37.627
for their lives?

02:38.377 --> 02:39.457
[LEON] Yes, sir.

02:39.537 --> 02:40.917
And if that's not enough,

02:40.997 --> 02:43.207
then I'll pay
out of my own coffers.

02:43.297 --> 02:44.967
Will you spare them, sire?

02:45.047 --> 02:48.007
Hmm. This is not an easy choice.

02:48.087 --> 02:50.637
[LEON] <i>Okay, bastard!</i>
<i>Milk it for all its worth!</i>

02:50.717 --> 02:51.927
[♪ gentle music playing]

02:52.007 --> 02:54.847
I must ask,
why would you do this for them?

02:55.557 --> 02:58.477
[LEON] Our fates seem
to be inexplicably intertwined.

02:59.267 --> 03:00.317
It's better this way.

03:00.727 --> 03:02.687
My goal was to live
a relaxed life,

03:02.777 --> 03:04.397
not to keep climbing the ranks.

03:05.357 --> 03:07.317
This way,
maybe I can start over.

03:07.407 --> 03:08.657
[chuckles softly]

03:09.527 --> 03:10.737
In that case,

03:11.277 --> 03:12.697
they should consider
themselves lucky

03:12.787 --> 03:14.077
to have such a good friend.

03:15.077 --> 03:16.077
Your Majesty.

03:16.457 --> 03:17.667
If it's all right with you,

03:17.747 --> 03:19.497
I would be happy
to take it from here.

03:20.167 --> 03:21.127
[ROLAND] Hmm?

03:21.207 --> 03:23.047
Hmm.

03:23.127 --> 03:24.547
Yes, very well.

03:24.627 --> 03:26.257
[LEON] <i>Hell to the yeah!</i>

03:26.337 --> 03:29.137
<i>I basically talked my way</i>
<i>to an early retirement!</i>

03:29.217 --> 03:31.637
<i>Lazy mob life, here I come!</i>

03:32.427 --> 03:33.887
There's one more thing.

03:33.967 --> 03:35.477
A matter concerning Angelica.

03:35.927 --> 03:36.847
[LEON] Hmm?

03:37.477 --> 03:38.977
-[JULIUS] Don't do it, Bartfort!
-[all straining]

03:39.057 --> 03:41.017
Are you trying to end up
in here with the rest of us?

03:41.107 --> 03:43.437
[growls] Let me at her!

03:43.517 --> 03:46.027
Marie! Your blood
will stain Murasamekai!

03:46.107 --> 03:49.237
First, where do you keep
getting all these rare items?

03:49.317 --> 03:51.027
Second,
I thought you were saving me!

03:51.117 --> 03:52.907
[LEON] That was before
I heard you made

03:52.987 --> 03:55.787
-Angie and Livia kiss your feet!
-[gasps]

03:57.867 --> 04:01.037
[gasps] I didn't mean to.
Well, I did, but I...

04:02.077 --> 04:04.207
Angie is in disgrace
since you made her tarnish

04:04.287 --> 04:05.457
her family's name!

04:06.007 --> 04:08.337
Do you know how much
you've hurt her and Livia?!

04:08.417 --> 04:11.467
I have no choice but to kill you
and restore their honor!

04:11.547 --> 04:12.847
[gasps]

04:12.927 --> 04:13.967
Fat chance!

04:14.047 --> 04:16.137
If you want to harm Marie,
you'll have to go through us!

04:16.767 --> 04:18.517
[LEON] Luxion,
you know what to do!

04:18.597 --> 04:19.887
[LUXION] <i>If you say so.</i>

04:19.977 --> 04:22.687
[LEON] 100%!

04:22.767 --> 04:24.647
[LUXION] <i>In that case,</i>
<i>one moment please.</i>

04:24.727 --> 04:25.647
[electricity crackling]

04:25.727 --> 04:26.647
[all screaming]

04:31.237 --> 04:33.027
[LEON] Why'd you zap me too?

04:33.117 --> 04:35.827
[LUXION] <i>Now,</i>
<i>has everyone calmed down?</i>

04:37.447 --> 04:39.787
[MARIE] We have to stay
on a floating island?

04:40.827 --> 04:43.537
-In your territory?
-[LEON] Yup.

04:43.627 --> 04:46.457
It has everything you need
to live a self-sufficient life.

04:46.837 --> 04:48.297
Basically, you're being exiled.

04:48.917 --> 04:52.087
Yeah. I'm gonna
have to pass, but thanks.

04:52.177 --> 04:53.137
Considering your crimes,

04:53.217 --> 04:54.547
it's the best offer
you're gonna get!

04:54.637 --> 04:56.347
Unless you'd prefer to,
you know, die.

04:56.427 --> 04:59.307
Well, go back to the table
and get a better deal.

04:59.387 --> 05:01.557
I'm a city girl
through and through.

05:02.137 --> 05:03.477
You just want to stay

05:03.557 --> 05:05.607
so you can build
another harem for yourself!

05:05.687 --> 05:08.067
Try acting like the grown-up
you are for once!

05:08.147 --> 05:09.187
You're one to talk!

05:09.277 --> 05:10.447
Stringing along the villainess

05:10.567 --> 05:12.197
and the protagonist
like some kinda player.

05:12.947 --> 05:15.947
Our relationship is 1,000% pure,
thank you!

05:16.027 --> 05:17.617
We're not like you!

05:17.697 --> 05:19.287
It's not my fault
you're such a wimp!

05:19.867 --> 05:21.747
It is your fault
I ended up here, though!

05:22.327 --> 05:24.077
Luxion! Say something!

05:24.497 --> 05:25.417
[LUXION] <i>Certainly.</i>

05:25.497 --> 05:28.127
<i>I have endless sympathy</i>
<i>for the unfortunate parents</i>

05:28.207 --> 05:30.007
<i>who had you two as children.</i>

05:30.087 --> 05:31.507
[both gasp]

05:31.587 --> 05:34.007
[both whimper]

05:34.757 --> 05:36.887
[LUXION] <i>Also, Marie is correct.</i>

05:36.967 --> 05:39.677
<i>The time has come for you</i>
<i>to make a decision, Master.</i>

05:39.767 --> 05:42.637
[groans] What? Be specific.

05:42.727 --> 05:44.477
[LUXION] <i>I am sure your visitors</i>

05:44.557 --> 05:46.437
<i>-will make it clear.</i>
-[LEON] Huh?

05:50.397 --> 05:51.487
-Leon.
-Good, you're here.

05:52.027 --> 05:53.447
[both whimper]

05:54.197 --> 05:55.697
We need to have a talk.

05:56.567 --> 05:58.277
And I'm afraid it can't wait.

06:01.327 --> 06:05.207
[LEON] So, what did you want
to chat about outside?

06:05.287 --> 06:06.207
Leon.

06:06.957 --> 06:08.207
You should know I love you.

06:08.287 --> 06:09.457
[gasps]

06:09.547 --> 06:10.797
[♪ gentle music playing]

06:10.877 --> 06:13.467
I'm not sure when,
but at some point,

06:13.547 --> 06:16.427
I started thinking about you
more than His Highness

06:16.717 --> 06:19.467
and looking forward
to the time we spent together.

06:20.807 --> 06:23.727
I felt relaxed around you,
like I could be myself.

06:23.807 --> 06:27.017
Eventually,
I realized it was love.

06:27.107 --> 06:28.897
[gasps]

06:30.317 --> 06:31.937
[LEON] <i>Why's she smiling?</i>

06:32.027 --> 06:33.987
<i>Whatever the reason,</i>
<i>it can't be good!</i>

06:34.567 --> 06:36.987
[gasps] We're bros! Help me out!

06:39.067 --> 06:41.037
Hold up! Who are you?!

06:41.117 --> 06:43.247
[CLEARE] <i>It's Cleare!</i>
<i>We've met before.</i>

06:43.867 --> 06:46.537
Wait.
You're the voice of <i>Vice's</i> AI.

06:46.617 --> 06:47.747
[CLEARE] <i>Hello again!</i>

06:48.497 --> 06:49.537
[LEON] Huh.

06:49.627 --> 06:52.167
But before that,
back at the elven ruins,

06:52.257 --> 06:53.587
you were the one
running the lab!

06:53.667 --> 06:54.797
[Cleare giggles]

06:54.877 --> 06:57.337
<i>Until my transfer</i>
<i>to this device.</i>

06:57.427 --> 06:58.757
I wasn't told.

06:58.837 --> 07:01.717
Hey!
Where'd that jerk run off to?

07:01.807 --> 07:04.307
[CLEARE] <i>I asked the professor</i>
<i>to take a back seat.</i>

07:04.387 --> 07:06.517
<i>He was more than happy</i>
<i>to oblige.</i>

07:06.597 --> 07:09.807
Yeah, bet he was more
than happy to abandon me.

07:09.897 --> 07:11.517
-[OLIVIA] Mr. Leon.
-[LEON] Hmm? Livia?

07:12.727 --> 07:15.447
I don't think I need to tell you
how much I love you.

07:16.237 --> 07:17.697
I don't believe
anyone's feelings

07:17.777 --> 07:19.027
are stronger than mine.

07:19.907 --> 07:21.157
Right. Goga!

07:21.237 --> 07:22.787
<i>What the hell am I saying?</i>

07:22.867 --> 07:26.907
We've both been patient,
but you do owe us an answer.

07:26.997 --> 07:28.417
Choose me or Livia.

07:28.917 --> 07:31.417
No, we're not even going to
force you to go that far.

07:32.167 --> 07:34.377
All we ask is you tell us
how you feel.

07:34.457 --> 07:35.917
-[gasps]
-[heart thumping]

07:36.007 --> 07:38.927
How I feel? The truth is...

07:45.517 --> 07:46.427
Here it goes.

07:48.937 --> 07:49.937
[takes deep breath]

07:51.437 --> 07:54.187
I love both of you! [echoing]

07:54.267 --> 07:55.687
[both chuckle softly]

07:55.777 --> 07:57.567
-[slaps]
-[Leon yells]

07:58.857 --> 08:00.907
<i>My dad was promoted</i>
<i>to upper sixth rank</i>

08:00.987 --> 08:03.327
<i>for saving so many evacuees.</i>

08:04.237 --> 08:07.077
<i>He's currently helping me repair</i>
<i>Arroganz and the</i> Partner.

08:09.117 --> 08:11.787
<i>Speaking of partners,</i>
<i>remember his ex, Zola?</i>

08:11.877 --> 08:13.837
<i>Her mansion burned down</i>
<i>during the war.</i>

08:14.497 --> 08:17.167
<i>She got her wish and avoided</i>
<i>her son being conscripted.</i>

08:17.547 --> 08:19.337
<i>All it cost was her title.</i>

08:20.677 --> 08:22.087
<i>Back in the capital,</i>

08:22.177 --> 08:23.557
<i>the balance of power</i>
<i>between the genders</i>

08:23.637 --> 08:25.257
<i>was beginning to equalize.</i>

08:26.267 --> 08:28.017
<i>And then there's me.</i>

08:30.687 --> 08:33.057
[ROLAND]
Viscount Leon Fou Bartfort,

08:33.147 --> 08:34.857
by all accounts,
you performed splendidly

08:34.937 --> 08:36.107
in the war.

08:36.817 --> 08:37.737
[Leon grumbles]

08:38.487 --> 08:39.987
<i>Just get on with it.</i>

08:40.067 --> 08:40.987
[ROLAND] Hmm.

08:41.067 --> 08:42.657
Now that it is over,

08:42.737 --> 08:44.237
I shall relieve you
of your duties

08:44.327 --> 08:45.827
as supreme commander.

08:45.907 --> 08:47.657
And instead, I'm promoting you

08:47.747 --> 08:49.367
to the rank
of count, lower third,

08:49.457 --> 08:50.867
as you so richly deserve.

08:50.957 --> 08:52.127
Huh?

08:52.207 --> 08:53.627
-A count?
-Oh, my word.

08:54.707 --> 08:56.377
[LEON] <i>What about our deal?!</i>

08:57.127 --> 08:59.297
[ROLAND] Given your
numerous achievements in battle,

08:59.377 --> 09:01.547
how could I not grant
such a hero of the kingdom

09:01.627 --> 09:03.797
a suitable title?
[chuckles smugly]

09:03.887 --> 09:06.597
That rank
at his age is unheard of.

09:06.677 --> 09:08.727
That's the highest title
for non-royals.

09:08.807 --> 09:10.847
[MAN] This egoist
will be out of control.

09:10.927 --> 09:12.847
-[gasps]
-[hushed chatter]

09:14.057 --> 09:15.977
[LEON]
<i>Everyone else is shocked too.</i>

09:16.517 --> 09:19.277
<i>You asshole!</i>
<i>You did this to spite me!</i>

09:19.357 --> 09:21.107
<i>You're the game's real villain!</i>

09:21.947 --> 09:23.657
[Roland chuckles]
<i>This is what you get</i>

09:23.737 --> 09:25.867
<i>for trying to outshine the king.</i>

09:27.077 --> 09:29.077
Your wish is my command,
Your Majesty.

09:29.157 --> 09:31.497
[ROLAND] <i>Surrendering</i>
<i>center stage without a fight.</i>

09:31.577 --> 09:35.037
Oh, and I'm looking forward
to your future exploits.

09:35.497 --> 09:36.497
[chuckles smugly]

09:37.587 --> 09:38.957
-[Leon huffs]
-[Roland laughing]

09:39.047 --> 09:41.127
[LEON] <i>Keep grinning,</i>
<i>you sadistic jerk!</i>

09:41.217 --> 09:42.667
<i>One day, I'm gonna</i>
<i>get you back good</i>

09:42.757 --> 09:44.967
<i>and wipe that smile</i>
<i>off your face!</i>

09:45.547 --> 09:47.217
[MARIE] You were promoted again.

09:48.137 --> 09:49.807
Congratulations
on your achievement.

09:49.887 --> 09:51.927
I mean that
with total sincerity.

09:52.387 --> 09:53.807
You might like being
an attention sponge,

09:53.887 --> 09:55.147
but I don't!

09:55.857 --> 09:57.397
While I'm here,
what do you want?

09:57.767 --> 10:00.607
I thought you might like to have
some important information

10:00.687 --> 10:01.857
regarding your favorite

10:01.937 --> 10:03.607
-otome game.
-What?

10:04.407 --> 10:06.197
[MARIE] You'd have no way
of knowing since you died

10:06.277 --> 10:07.697
after beating the first game,

10:07.777 --> 10:09.197
but more titles were announced,

10:09.277 --> 10:11.617
and it eventually
became a series.

10:11.707 --> 10:14.247
No way! That shit has sequels?!

10:14.327 --> 10:15.497
Shocking, right?

10:15.577 --> 10:17.337
Despite it not being popular,

10:17.417 --> 10:20.087
seems the devs were weirdly
passionate about the world.

10:20.167 --> 10:22.007
They should've stopped at one.

10:22.667 --> 10:24.627
[MARIE]
<i>Remember the land guardian?</i>

10:24.717 --> 10:26.927
<i>That was the final boss</i>
<i>of the first game.</i>

10:27.007 --> 10:28.637
<i>And the sky</i>
<i>and sea guardians appear</i>

10:28.717 --> 10:30.007
<i>in the third game.</i>

10:30.097 --> 10:31.807
If that's the case,

10:31.887 --> 10:35.017
then the first and third games
ended up being blended together.

10:35.557 --> 10:38.517
That's why I didn't recognize
the other two. [gasps]

10:39.107 --> 10:41.027
I'm almost scared to ask,
but does that mean--

10:41.107 --> 10:43.187
[MARIE] Bingo!
There's still the boss

10:43.277 --> 10:44.857
from the second game
to deal with.

10:44.947 --> 10:46.567
This world's not
out of danger yet.

10:46.657 --> 10:49.197
[LEON] Gimme a break!

10:49.907 --> 10:51.697
Oh, how the tables have turned.

10:51.787 --> 10:53.157
Looks like I'm the one who knows

10:53.247 --> 10:55.207
the ins and outs
of the game this time.

10:55.287 --> 10:57.537
So, how about you and I
strike a deal?

10:57.917 --> 11:00.787
You beast! What is it you want?

11:00.877 --> 11:04.087
Well, for starters,
since you asked...

11:04.667 --> 11:05.587
[chuckles]

11:06.627 --> 11:08.217
Please give me an allowance!

11:08.797 --> 11:09.717
Huh?

11:10.427 --> 11:12.217
Carla and Kyle will be fine,

11:12.307 --> 11:15.097
but those prettiots could never
survive in the boonies!

11:15.177 --> 11:16.097
-[♪ pop music playing]
-[men laughing]

11:16.187 --> 11:18.057
[MARIE] <i>What did I do</i>
<i>to deserve this?</i>

11:18.147 --> 11:19.977
<i>They're as useless</i>
<i>as the hobosexuals</i>

11:20.057 --> 11:21.437
<i>in my previous life!</i>

11:21.517 --> 11:22.977
[JULIUS] Sparkle! [echoing]

11:24.147 --> 11:25.067
You've got a real talent

11:25.147 --> 11:26.987
for attracting
the most shit guys.

11:27.567 --> 11:29.617
Fine. You can have an allowance.

11:29.697 --> 11:31.237
[gasps] Thanks!

11:31.327 --> 11:33.907
You're the most thoughtful,
selfish, big brother ever!

11:34.747 --> 11:36.037
I agreed to the deal,

11:36.117 --> 11:38.327
so back off and tell me
about the second game.

11:38.417 --> 11:39.377
'Kay.

11:39.997 --> 11:41.377
It doesn't take place here.

11:41.457 --> 11:44.377
The devs changed the location
to the Alzer Republic.

11:45.297 --> 11:46.757
Why does that ring a bell?

11:46.837 --> 11:48.127
[♪ mysterious music playing]

11:48.217 --> 11:49.887
<i>That's right, from the poster.</i>

11:50.717 --> 11:52.347
<i>Apparently,</i>
<i>the world is destroyed</i>

11:52.427 --> 11:53.927
<i>unless the protagonist</i>
<i>gets together</i>

11:54.007 --> 11:55.387
<i>with a romantic interest.</i>

12:00.557 --> 12:03.147
Couldn't they have come up
with a different storyline?

12:04.937 --> 12:07.647
[LUXION] <i>You are the definition</i>
<i>of a worrywart.</i>

12:07.737 --> 12:11.197
<i>Going to the Alzer Republic</i>
<i>as a precaution seems extreme.</i>

12:11.277 --> 12:12.987
Please, like I had a choice.

12:13.077 --> 12:14.577
Imagine if there's
someone like Marie

12:14.657 --> 12:16.287
causing trouble over there.

12:16.367 --> 12:17.287
Besides, I'm curious

12:17.367 --> 12:19.327
how changing the first game
affected things.

12:19.417 --> 12:20.917
[LUXION] <i>If you stayed</i>
<i>in the kingdom,</i>

12:20.997 --> 12:23.037
<i>you would be quite popular.</i>

12:23.127 --> 12:24.837
[LEON] <i>Don't remind me.</i>

12:24.917 --> 12:27.047
<i>Just how tough</i>
<i>is this world for mobs?</i>

12:27.877 --> 12:28.797
[BALCUS] Leon.

12:29.627 --> 12:32.097
-[LEON] What's up, old man?
-Got a second?

12:34.887 --> 12:37.137
-An engagement party?
-How 'bout it?

12:37.227 --> 12:38.267
I was kind of hoping

12:38.347 --> 12:39.687
you'd be able
to make an appearance.

12:39.767 --> 12:43.187
You know, I gotta say,
I way underestimated Nicks.

12:43.267 --> 12:45.567
I didn't think
he'd find a girl so soon.

12:45.647 --> 12:47.687
Yeah,
crazy how these things happen.

12:48.527 --> 12:50.567
I might have time
before studying abroad.

12:50.647 --> 12:52.407
Just kidding,
of course I'll be there!

12:53.027 --> 12:54.197
[♪ lively music playing]

12:55.447 --> 12:56.367
Wait a minute.

12:57.247 --> 12:58.867
Something doesn't
feel right here.

12:59.657 --> 13:01.367
Isn't this your shindig, bro?

13:02.207 --> 13:04.377
So how come I've got
the flashy outfit?

13:05.667 --> 13:06.587
About that.

13:06.667 --> 13:09.047
Right! It's because
you're a count!

13:09.717 --> 13:10.627
What?

13:11.127 --> 13:12.047
Luxion.

13:12.137 --> 13:14.137
Doesn't all this
seem strange to you?

13:14.217 --> 13:15.797
[LUXION]
<i>You are imagining things.</i>

13:15.887 --> 13:18.637
<i>Everyone is just nervous.</i>

13:18.727 --> 13:21.727
[LEON] <i>No,</i>
<i>something's definitely off.</i>

13:21.807 --> 13:23.897
<i>Wait. Don't tell me.</i>

13:28.107 --> 13:29.777
[♪ upbeat music playing]

13:29.857 --> 13:31.147
[gasps]

13:36.157 --> 13:37.947
The hell?! You tricked me!

13:38.037 --> 13:40.957
Uh, I wouldn't
call it a trick actually.

13:41.037 --> 13:43.287
More of a deliberate
misrepresentation.

13:43.917 --> 13:46.127
[LUXION] <i>Since indecision</i>
<i>is your strong suit,</i>

13:46.207 --> 13:47.377
<i>we took the initiative</i>

13:47.457 --> 13:49.547
<i>and made arrangements</i>
<i>on your behalf.</i>

13:49.627 --> 13:52.047
No. How could you do this to me?

13:53.717 --> 13:56.047
<i>Crap! The room's full</i>
<i>of all the bigwigs!</i>

13:56.137 --> 13:57.927
<i>I can't run away!</i>

13:58.347 --> 13:59.847
-[GILBERT] Congratulations.
-[gasps]

14:00.347 --> 14:03.137
Milord,
a letter from His Majesty.

14:03.847 --> 14:05.647
What? From the king?

14:08.767 --> 14:11.107
I understand you've been running
from marriage,

14:11.187 --> 14:12.647
so I've done everything
in my power

14:12.737 --> 14:14.447
to expedite the process for you.

14:14.527 --> 14:15.527
[Leon gasps]

14:15.617 --> 14:16.827
[ROLAND] <i>Welcome</i>
<i>to the beginning</i>

14:16.907 --> 14:18.237
<i>of the end of your life.</i>

14:18.327 --> 14:21.247
<i>Sincerely, your ever-wonderful,</i>
<i>talented king.</i>

14:21.907 --> 14:25.327
-[huffs] Damn it all!
-[Roland laughs]

14:25.417 --> 14:27.087
[whining]

14:32.507 --> 14:34.967
[ANGELICA] We're sorry
for ambushing you like this.

14:35.047 --> 14:36.427
But we all know
you would've kept

14:36.507 --> 14:38.217
dodging the question
if we hadn't.

14:38.797 --> 14:40.057
That's true.

14:40.137 --> 14:42.597
But you guys could have anyone.
Why choose me?

14:43.307 --> 14:44.937
Because you're you, Leon.

14:45.437 --> 14:47.517
So, are you going
to be my husband?

14:47.607 --> 14:48.647
[gasps]

14:49.357 --> 14:52.487
She said it best.
There is no one else like you.

14:52.567 --> 14:53.737
[gasps]

14:55.197 --> 14:56.947
[OLIVIA] I'll never let you go.

14:57.027 --> 14:59.077
[giggling]

15:00.117 --> 15:02.037
Well, I guess if you say so.

15:02.117 --> 15:03.827
[church bell chiming]

15:04.907 --> 15:06.957
[crowd clapping]

15:07.037 --> 15:08.707
[LEON] <i>I mean,</i>

15:08.787 --> 15:10.457
<i>it's not like I don't like them.</i>

15:11.047 --> 15:12.587
<i>In fact, I love them.</i>

15:16.007 --> 15:20.177
<i>As far as ambushes go,</i>
<i>this one doesn't suck.</i>

15:21.847 --> 15:24.097
[LUXION] <i>Congratulations</i>
<i>on your engagement.</i>

15:24.727 --> 15:27.307
[CLEARE] <i>What a truly</i>
<i>wonderful ceremony!</i>

15:27.897 --> 15:29.807
How about an apology
for keeping me in the dark,

15:29.897 --> 15:31.267
you sadistic spheres?

15:31.937 --> 15:35.277
[grumbles] <i>I leave</i>
<i>for the Republic tomorrow.</i>

15:35.357 --> 15:37.987
<i>Feels crappy to bail so soon</i>
<i>after the engagement.</i>

15:38.067 --> 15:40.487
-[knock on door]
-Uh.

15:43.537 --> 15:44.447
[Angelica chuckles softly]

15:45.787 --> 15:47.457
[screams]

15:47.537 --> 15:49.707
I don't know if I'm ready
for this yet!

15:49.787 --> 15:50.917
Peek.

15:50.997 --> 15:53.127
-It feels like it’s too soon!
-You can relax for now, Leon.

15:53.207 --> 15:55.797
We were hoping the three of us
could have a conversation.

15:55.877 --> 15:57.337
-[LEON] Peek?
-We haven't had a chance

15:57.417 --> 15:59.637
to talk much
with everything going on lately.

16:00.137 --> 16:01.887
-Let's fix that.
-[LEON] Right!

16:01.967 --> 16:04.967
[sputtering] That’s what
I thought! Totally fine!

16:05.807 --> 16:07.177
[♪ gentle music playing]

16:07.267 --> 16:09.347
We wanted to say we're grateful.

16:09.437 --> 16:11.267
Since the day we met you,

16:11.357 --> 16:14.187
it feels like our lives
have completely changed.

16:14.267 --> 16:15.567
And no matter what,

16:15.647 --> 16:17.487
you were always there
by our sides.

16:18.317 --> 16:20.157
You've helped us out so much.

16:20.617 --> 16:22.617
-[chuckles softly]
-[LEON] Angie, Livia.

16:24.447 --> 16:25.617
I owe you guys.

16:26.447 --> 16:27.657
Without you in my life,

16:27.747 --> 16:29.497
I don't think I would
have made it this far.

16:30.127 --> 16:33.707
And I guess the same goes
for Marie and her morons.

16:33.787 --> 16:34.997
They do mean well.

16:35.667 --> 16:37.757
Leon, you'd better come back.

16:38.417 --> 16:39.757
We'll both be here

16:39.837 --> 16:41.507
waiting for you.
[chuckles softly]

16:42.387 --> 16:45.057
I will. I promise.

16:46.017 --> 16:47.597
<i>-</i>[laughing]
-[LEON] <i>Afterwards,</i>

16:47.677 --> 16:49.307
<i>we stayed up</i>
<i>the entire night</i>...

16:49.387 --> 16:50.387
[laughing]

16:50.477 --> 16:51.517
<i>...just talking.</i>

16:53.517 --> 16:56.027
<i>Trust me,</i>
<i>it was absolute torture.</i>

16:57.067 --> 16:58.437
[trees rustling]

17:04.027 --> 17:05.287
Rauda...

17:05.947 --> 17:07.487
everybody's gone now.

17:08.867 --> 17:10.457
First our father and mother,

17:11.167 --> 17:13.587
then you, and even Vandel.

17:14.127 --> 17:15.667
[♪ somber music playing]

17:17.207 --> 17:19.087
It feels like
you're still with me.

17:19.507 --> 17:21.587
Maybe it's just because
I don't wanna be alone.

17:23.637 --> 17:24.967
<i>If only I'd been stronger,</i>

17:25.057 --> 17:27.057
<i>things would've</i>
<i>turned out differently.</i>

17:27.637 --> 17:32.057
For some reason, I'm reminded
of the elf chief's words.

17:33.607 --> 17:37.317
And of him, Leon Fou Bartfort.

17:38.527 --> 17:39.937
[PRIESTESS] <i>If you're somehow</i>
<i>able to find</i>

17:40.027 --> 17:41.697
<i>a way to walk together,</i>

17:41.777 --> 17:44.527
<i>this path of thorns</i>
<i>will instead be bathed in light.</i>

17:44.617 --> 17:47.287
<i>They shall be a reliable source</i>
<i>of support for you.</i>

17:48.907 --> 17:50.157
♪

17:50.947 --> 17:52.827
[RAYMOND] I can't believe
you're leaving.

17:52.917 --> 17:55.587
Man, you couldn't have picked
a worse time for it.

17:55.667 --> 17:58.167
Right when you started to have
some luck with the ladies.

17:58.547 --> 18:00.957
We're being treated like heroes
for our evacuation efforts,

18:01.047 --> 18:01.967
so we can't complain.

18:02.047 --> 18:05.097
[BOTH] We're entering
our popular phase!

18:05.887 --> 18:07.597
Keep this up,
it'll be short-lived.

18:07.677 --> 18:09.217
-[CLARICE] You can't leave yet.
-[gasps]

18:10.017 --> 18:11.727
[LEON] Oh. Afternoon, you two.

18:14.477 --> 18:16.817
If you get tired
of the Redgraves, don't forget.

18:17.317 --> 18:19.227
House Atlee's here for you.

18:19.317 --> 18:20.817
-[gasps]
-It goes without saying,

18:20.897 --> 18:23.487
but House Roseblade's doors
are always open.

18:24.107 --> 18:26.117
What if we just
pulled the trigger?

18:26.197 --> 18:28.117
Indeed, we could
run away and elope.

18:28.197 --> 18:29.487
[laughs]

18:29.577 --> 18:30.737
[LUCAS] Mr. Leon.

18:31.577 --> 18:32.617
[LEON] Master!

18:33.407 --> 18:34.867
I believe seeing
the outside world

18:34.957 --> 18:38.337
will help you grow,
both as a noble and a man.

18:38.707 --> 18:40.747
May you continue
to deepen your code of chivalry

18:40.837 --> 18:43.507
-as you push forward.
-I will, sir!

18:43.587 --> 18:44.797
[LUXION] <i>Pardon,</i>

18:44.877 --> 18:46.967
<i>but it is nearly time to depart.</i>

18:47.047 --> 18:48.887
<i>I have procured a new ship</i>

18:48.967 --> 18:50.217
<i>so you will not</i>
<i>embarrass yourself</i>

18:50.307 --> 18:51.887
<i>as a representative</i>
<i>of the kingdom.</i>

18:56.977 --> 18:58.647
Nice! [laughs]

18:58.727 --> 19:01.027
[LUXION]
<i>It is called the</i> Einhorn.

19:01.107 --> 19:03.027
<i>I felt it worthy</i>
<i>of today's departure.</i>

19:04.107 --> 19:06.527
Let's take this beaut
for a scoot.

19:14.247 --> 19:15.787
[CLEARE] <i>I am confused.</i>

19:15.867 --> 19:17.667
<i>Why were you not there</i>
<i>for his departure?</i>

19:18.497 --> 19:21.127
Imagine, the trouble
we would have caused him.

19:21.207 --> 19:23.257
I guarantee
there would have been tears.

19:23.337 --> 19:25.837
[CLEARE] <i>I see! How admirable!</i>

19:25.917 --> 19:27.427
[ANGELICA]
There must be a good reason

19:27.507 --> 19:29.677
why he suddenly decided
to study abroad.

19:29.757 --> 19:31.597
We plan to study hard ourselves

19:31.677 --> 19:34.177
so we can better help him
when he comes back!

19:34.847 --> 19:37.437
Let's make a pact that
when Leon finally returns home,

19:37.517 --> 19:39.687
he'll be amazed
by how much we've grown!

19:39.767 --> 19:40.687
[ANGELICA] We'll do our best!

19:40.767 --> 19:43.277
-[OLIVIA] Just like Leon!
-[both chuckle]

19:44.687 --> 19:46.607
It's not fair!

19:46.697 --> 19:48.447
After that lovely send-off,

19:48.527 --> 19:49.947
who'd wanna go
on this stupid trip?!

19:50.657 --> 19:51.987
-[thudding]
-[crying]

19:52.077 --> 19:53.657
[LUXION] <i>It is wise</i>
<i>to get your tantrum</i>

19:53.737 --> 19:56.827
<i>out of the way before we land.</i>
<i>Also...</i>

19:57.407 --> 19:59.747
<i>are you going</i>
<i>to open this mystery box?</i>

19:59.827 --> 20:02.457
<i>Apparently, it was brought</i>
<i>aboard from the palace.</i>

20:02.547 --> 20:04.337
Well, that might
distract me at least.

20:05.297 --> 20:07.967
Maybe it's the royals' gift
to the Republic?

20:11.807 --> 20:13.427
[groans softly]

20:18.227 --> 20:20.767
You did not just
close the lid on me!

20:20.857 --> 20:22.937
Would you prefer that
I throw the box overboard?!

20:23.017 --> 20:25.437
[both panting heavily]

20:26.607 --> 20:28.197
I... I can explain.

20:28.277 --> 20:30.277
[♪ closing theme song playing]

20:32.157 --> 20:33.697
What the heck is that?

20:34.287 --> 20:36.697
A humble monument
in honor of our Saint.

20:36.787 --> 20:39.207
It took a while to find
a worthy craftsman.

20:39.287 --> 20:41.457
You can rest assured
we spared no expense.

20:41.537 --> 20:43.457
Our allowance
from Bartfort was barely enough

20:43.547 --> 20:44.457
to cover the cost.

20:44.547 --> 20:46.257
The artist tried
making your chest bigger,

20:46.337 --> 20:47.337
but we wanted realism.

20:49.717 --> 20:51.137
Gone, just like that.

20:51.217 --> 20:53.007
An entire fortune
down the drain.

20:53.097 --> 20:54.847
It was supposed
to last us a year.

20:54.927 --> 20:56.347
We're screwed.

20:56.427 --> 20:58.137
[whimpers]

20:59.437 --> 21:02.477
[MARIE] These lovesick airheads
are driving me crazy!

21:02.557 --> 21:03.607
[thunderclap]

21:06.437 --> 21:08.897
<i>The queen was furious</i>
<i>when she found out.</i>

21:09.447 --> 21:11.867
[whimpering]

21:12.487 --> 21:15.157
You were given a second chance,
and this is how you repay

21:15.237 --> 21:16.987
those who stuck
their necks out for you?

21:17.077 --> 21:18.077
[growls]

21:18.157 --> 21:20.367
Your punishment will be
to study abroad with Leon!

21:21.247 --> 21:22.167
[sighs]

21:23.497 --> 21:24.667
You probably guessed,

21:24.787 --> 21:26.377
but the rest of them
are here too.

21:27.337 --> 21:29.377
[JILK] Exciting, isn't it,
Your Highness?

21:29.467 --> 21:31.627
-[JULIUS] Indeed.
-[CHRIS] Alzer, huh?

21:31.717 --> 21:34.257
[BRAD] I'll be happy anywhere
if Marie is there!

21:34.347 --> 21:36.637
[GREG] One day, I'll become
a man worthy of her.

21:36.717 --> 21:39.557
[JULIUS] Brand new adventure.
Brand new boys!

21:39.637 --> 21:42.137
[ALL] Yeah! [laugh]

21:42.897 --> 21:44.147
Isn't it awesome?

21:44.227 --> 21:46.187
We're gonna spend
lots of time together!

21:46.267 --> 21:48.227
You won't have
to be alone, brother.

21:48.317 --> 21:50.397
[LEON] This is 100 times worse!

21:50.987 --> 21:53.527
[LUXION] <i>This must be that</i>
<i>beautiful bond between siblings</i>

21:53.617 --> 21:54.907
<i>I have heard so much about.</i>

21:55.487 --> 21:58.617
<i>You certainly look related</i>
<i>when you make that face.</i>

21:58.697 --> 22:00.907
[both growl] Shut up, droid!

22:01.537 --> 22:03.207
[LEON] I can't win!

22:03.287 --> 22:05.537
Damn this shitty otome game!

22:06.457 --> 22:10.377
This world
really is tough for mobs!

22:12.927 --> 22:14.927
TRAPPED IN A DATING SIM 2

23:36.677 --> 23:39.927
SUPREME COMMANDER
MIURA KAZUYA
